<ResourceDictionary xmlns="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml/presentation"
                    xmlns:x="http://schemas.microsoft.com/winfx/2006/xaml">

    <!-- ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
         Git #2147 — ported verbatim from
         desktop/ShaneBuilder/wpf-handoff/App Shell v2 Color Palette.html.
         Every hex value below is copied exactly from that doc; resource
         keys follow its suggested Brush.Category.Name convention (this is
         a fresh app with no prior brush-naming convention to map to).

         Section 10 (Claude Chat Pane, "Brush.Claude.*") is a SEPARATE warm
         sub-palette for the embedded Claude webview only — per the palette
         doc, it must never leak into the shell's cool-navy palette (all
         other sections here) and vice versa. Keep additions to the correct
         side of that line.
         ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->

